          "description": "Most workflow files reference actions by mutable tag (`@v4`). When a tag is poisoned, every workflow run automatically picks up the malicious code — no PR, no review, no notification. SHA pinning is the primary defense, but the pinned SHA must be verified as reachable from a known branch or tag in the parent repository — not just resolvable via the GitHub API.",
