          "vendorSlug": "monday",
          "section": "1.3",
          "title": "Enable Monday Certificate Encryption",
          "description": "- Encrypting SAML assertions keeps identity attributes and authentication claims confidential as they pass through the browser between IdP and Monday.com - Unencrypted assertions can be read or tampered with by anyone able to intercept the redirect, enabling identity spoofing - Signing and encryption together ensure assertions are both authentic and unreadable, defeating replay and forgery attempts - Protects the trust relationship at the core of SSO, where a forged assertion equals a full account login",
