          "section": "4.1",
          "title": "Configure Data Export Controls",
          "description": "- Wiz findings and vulnerability reports are effectively a map of exploitable weaknesses across your cloud, so uncontrolled export hands attackers a ready-made target list - Restricting bulk export to Admins and logging every export limits who can remove this data and creates accountability - Expiring, password-protected, internal-only share links prevent sensitive reports from leaking through forwarded or public URLs - Alerting on large exports surfaces insider data theft or a compromised account exfiltrating posture data",
